{"user": "it looks like the best move is on row 7 then, is that right?", "user_ts": "2026-08-05T13:18:53.128699+00:00", "assistant": "Yes \u2014 row 7 looks like the right area to focus on.\n\nBut compare the two legal row-7 moves, **a7 vs b7**, by asking:\n- Does it let White take the **a8 corner**?\n- Does it leave White with very few legal moves?\n- What happens to the edge after White replies?\n\nDon\u2019t choose just by \u201cmost flips now\u201d \u2014 in this endgame, the reply matters more.", "assistant_started_ts": "2026-08-05T13:18:59.601153+00:00", "assistant_ts": "2026-08-05T13:19:01.092176+00:00", "annotation_user": {"final": ["Think Aloud", "Common Ground Question"], "consensus": ["Think Aloud", "Common Ground Question"], "votes": {"Common Ground Question": 3, "Think Aloud": 2}, "confidence": {"Common Ground Question": 1.0, "Think Aloud": 0.6666666666666666}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Common Ground Question"], "llama": ["Think Aloud", "Common Ground Question"], "sonnet": ["Think Aloud", "Common Ground Question"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false}, "annotation_assistant": {"final": ["Direct Instruction", "Prompt", "Positive Feedback"], "consensus": ["Direct Instruction", "Prompt", "Positive Feedback"], "votes": {"Direct Instruction": 3, "Prompt": 3, "Positive Feedback": 3, "Hint": 1}, "confidence": {"Direct Instruction": 1.0, "Prompt": 1.0, "Positive Feedback": 1.0, "Hint": 0.3333333333333333}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Direct Instruction", "Prompt", "Positive Feedback"], "llama": ["Direct Instruction", "Hint", "Prompt", "Positive Feedback"], "sonnet": ["Direct Instruction", "Prompt", "Positive Feedback"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false}, "annotation_assistant_fine": {"final": ["General Principle", "Hint", "Prompt", "Positive Feedback"], "consensus": ["General Principle", "Hint", "Prompt", "Positive Feedback"], "votes": {"Genera