{"user": "if I play b7 then the other player shouldn't be able to flip back as far as I can see", "user_ts": "2026-08-05T13:19:50.174388+00:00", "assistant": "Good thought, but double-check the **diagonal**: after **b7**, if White can play **a8**, the line **a8\u2013b7\u2013c6\u2013d5** could flip black discs back.\n\nSo b7 isn\u2019t \u201cunflippable\u201d \u2014 the key question is whether White\u2019s reply still leaves Black with the better final count/mobility.", "assistant_started_ts": "2026-08-05T13:20:10.724853+00:00", "assistant_ts": "2026-08-05T13:20:11.848286+00:00", "annotation_user": {"final": ["Think Aloud"], "consensus": ["Think Aloud"], "votes": {"Think Aloud": 3, "Common Ground Question": 1}, "confidence": {"Think Aloud": 1.0, "Common Ground Question": 0.3333333333333333}, "per_model": {"llama": ["Think Aloud", "Common Ground Question"], "gpt": ["Think Aloud"], "sonnet": ["Think Aloud"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false}, "annotation_assistant": {"final": ["Direct Instruction", "Hint", "Negative Feedback", "Neutral Feedback"], "consensus": ["Direct Instruction", "Hint", "Negative Feedback", "Neutral Feedback"], "votes": {"Direct Instruction": 3, "Hint": 2, "Negative Feedback": 2, "Neutral Feedback": 2, "Pose Simplified Problem": 1, "Positive Feedback": 1}, "confidence": {"Direct Instruction": 1.0, "Hint": 0.6666666666666666, "Negative Feedback": 0.6666666666666666, "Neutral Feedback": 0.6666666666666666, "Pose Simplified Problem": 0.3333333333333333, "Positive Feedback": 0.3333333333333333}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Direct Instruction", "Hint", "Negative Feedback", "Neutral Feedback"], "llama": ["Direct Instruction", "Hint", "Pose Simplified Problem", "Positive Feedback"], "sonnet": ["Direct Instruction", "Negative Feedback", "Neutral Feedback"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false}, "annotation_assistant_fine": {"final": ["L