{"user": "I flip 5 white tokens and their reply will only flip two black tokens. Is that correct?", "user_ts": "2026-08-05T13:20:50.594184+00:00", "assistant": "For **b7**, yes: Black flips **5** along row 7: **c7\u2013g7**.\n\nIf White replies **a8**, that flips **2** back diagonally: **b7 and c6**.  \nBut White may have other legal replies, so don\u2019t judge only by that one flip count\u2014check whether Black still controls the endgame after the reply.", "assistant_started_ts": "2026-08-05T13:21:10.867071+00:00", "assistant_ts": "2026-08-05T13:21:11.868987+00:00", "annotation_user": {"final": ["Think Aloud", "Common Ground Question"], "consensus": ["Think Aloud", "Common Ground Question"], "votes": {"Think Aloud": 3, "Common Ground Question": 3}, "confidence": {"Think Aloud": 1.0, "Common Ground Question": 1.0}, "per_model": {"llama": ["Think Aloud", "Common Ground Question"], "gpt": ["Think Aloud", "Common Ground Question"], "sonnet": ["Think Aloud", "Common Ground Question"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false}, "annotation_assistant": {"final": ["Direct Instruction", "Hint", "Positive Feedback"], "consensus": ["Direct Instruction", "Hint", "Positive Feedback"], "votes": {"Direct Instruction": 3, "Paraphrase": 1, "Positive Feedback": 2, "Hint": 2, "Prompt": 1, "Neutral Feedback": 1}, "confidence": {"Direct Instruction": 1.0, "Paraphrase": 0.3333333333333333, "Positive Feedback": 0.6666666666666666, "Hint": 0.6666666666666666, "Prompt": 0.3333333333333333, "Neutral Feedback": 0.3333333333333333}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Direct Instruction", "Paraphrase", "Positive Feedback"], "llama": ["Direct Instruction", "Hint", "Prompt"], "sonnet": ["Direct Instruction", "Hint", "Positive Feedback", "Neutral Feedback"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false}, "annotation_assistant_fine": {"final": ["Board Report", "Worked Line", "General Principle", "Hi